5. The Receiving Party agrees for the period specified in Section 13 that it will:
a. Restrict disclosure of the Confidential Information to the minimum required number of people (such as employees, directors, officers, legal counsels, accountants or consultants who shall also be personally bound to maintain the Information in confidence);
b. Direct its employees, agents and subcontractors to abide by non-disclosure terms at least as protective of the Confidential Information as those set forth herein;
c. Maintain the confidentiality and take proper measures to protect the secrecy of the Confidential Information, using the same degree of care that it uses to protect its own confidential information, but in any event shall use at least commercially reasonable care .;
